// include: hosts
// Estate status and evidence grid: one row per machine in scope, worst first. Selecting a row drives the resource detail.
// Kept to the columns an engineer reads first; the explanation for the selected machine is under Resource detail, in full sentences.
Hosts
| sort by Rank asc, Machine asc
| project Machine, Assessment, Evidence = EvidenceState, CpuP95 = round(CpuP95, 1), CpuPeak = round(CpuMax, 1),
    MemP95 = round(MemP95, 1), FreePct = round(DiskFreeNowPct, 1)
